          "headersSize": 628,
          "bodySize": 7602,
          "postData": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"query\":\"lead guitar tone for barracuda\",\"intent\":{\"amp_families\":[\"Marshall JMP\",\"Marshall JCM800\"],\"artist\":\"Heart\",\"character\":[\"Gritty\",\"Aggressive\",\"Hot-Rodded\"],\"effects\":[{\"name\":\"Flanger\",\"purpose\":\"Metallic, hollowed-out sweep\",\"starting_point\":\"Manual 2.0, Feedback 85%\"}],\"gain\":\"High\",\"guitar\":\"Gibson Les Paul\",\"pickup\":\"Humbucker\",\"research_notes\":\"Barracuda guitar tone settings — Heart | ToneMirror (https://www.tonemirror.so/tones/heart-barracuda):\\nToneMirror takes the original recipe above and adapts it to your guitar, amp, and pedals — so you can chase the \\\"Barracuda\\\" tone on a Katana, a Helix, a tube combo, or anything else. The translation accounts for EQ curve, gain structure, and pickup type so the result actually sounds like the record, not just the same knob numbers on different gear.\\n\\nBarracuda (Riff · Distorted) by Heart — Guitar Tone Settings & Rig | GuitarToneAdapt (https://guitartoneadapt.com/tone/barracuda--heart--riff--distorted--guitar/):\\nThe Barracuda by Heart guitar tone is built on a Music Man head, dialed in atgain 5.5/10, bass 5, mid 6, treble 6.5, presence 5.5(community-researched baseline). Full breakdown below — then adapt every knob to your exact guitar and amp, ...\\n\\nBarracuda Riff Tone Settings | Heart | TonesMatch (https://tonesmatch.com/tones/barracuda-heart-riff-distorted-10055):\\nApril 20, 2026 -Recreate Heart's Barracuda riff tone with amp settings, pickup choice, and pedal chain — adapted to your specific guitar and amp. Free to browse.\\n\\nlead guitar from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart | built with ToneDB (https://www.tonedb.co/tones/heart/barracuda/lead-guitar-3140):\\nRecreate the iconicleadguitartonefrom \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart. Features: Gibson Les Paul, Marshall JMP. Includes complete signal chain,gearrecommendations, and recreation tips.\\n\\nBarracuda by Heart(Solo · Distorted) — Guitar Tone (https://guitartoneadapt.com/tone/barracuda--heart--solo--distorted--guitar/):\\nHow to dial in theBarracuda(Heart)guitartone: amp settings (gain 6, bass 5, mid 6, treble 7),gearand effects. Adapt it to your exactrigfree.\\n\\nToneMirror - Guitar Tone Matcher for Any Song & Any Rig (https://www.tonemirror.so/):\\nMatch anyguitartoneto thegearyou own. Pick any song and get its exact amp settings, pickup position, tuning, and pedal chain, adapted for theguitaror bassrigyou already play.\\n\\nToneMatcher — Recreate Any Song's Guitar Tone With Your Gear (https://tonematcher.com/):\\nAIguitartonerecipes for thegearyou already own. Search any song and get exact amp and pedal settings to recreate its sound with yourrig.\\n\\nlead guitar from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart | built with ToneDB (https://www.tonedb.co/tones/heart/barracuda/lead-guitar):\\nRecreate the iconic lead guitar tone from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart. Features:Gibson SG Standard (or Ibanez Destroyer), Marshall JMP 100W Super Lead, A/DA Flanger. Includes complete signal chain, gear recommendations, and recreation tips.\\n\\nHeart - Barracuda amp tone | Fractal Audio Systems Forum (https://forum.fractalaudio.com/threads/heart-barracuda-amp-tone.61916/):\\nDecember 19, 2012 -“I paid $140 for the guitar and $160 for the amp. My entire gear investment was 300 bucks (laughs)! That’s what I went on tour with, that rig and a folding chair for an amp stand.” · Click to expand... ... Search the forum and Axe-Change for Javajunkie's very recent Barracuda flanger settings. He painstakingly recreated that signature ADA flanger tone.\\n\\nHow to Recreate the Heart ‘Barracuda’ Gallop Guitar Tone (https://songsfrommemory.com/tone-recipe-how-to-recreate-the-heart-barracuda-gallop/):\\nMay 2, 2026 -Amp Model:USA Lead Brt (Mesa Mark I).Flanger Block: Use the “A/DA Flanger” type. Set the Manual to 2.0 and Feedback to 85% for that metallic “hollowed out” tone.\",\"research_used\":true,\"search_queries\":[\"Heart Barracuda\",\"Marshall JMP\",\"High-gain Flanger\"],\"song\":\"Barracuda\",\"styles\":[\"Hard Rock\",\"80s Rock\"],\"summary\":\"Captures the aggressive, high-gain lead tone of Heart's 'Barracuda,' characterized by a hot-rodded British amp sound and a distinct metallic flanger effect.\"},\"research_notes\":\"Barracuda guitar tone settings — Heart | ToneMirror (https://www.tonemirror.so/tones/heart-barracuda):\\nToneMirror takes the original recipe above and adapts it to your guitar, amp, and pedals — so you can chase the \\\"Barracuda\\\" tone on a Katana, a Helix, a tube combo, or anything else. The translation accounts for EQ curve, gain structure, and pickup type so the result actually sounds like the record, not just the same knob numbers on different gear.\\n\\nBarracuda (Riff · Distorted) by Heart — Guitar Tone Settings & Rig | GuitarToneAdapt (https://guitartoneadapt.com/tone/barracuda--heart--riff--distorted--guitar/):\\nThe Barracuda by Heart guitar tone is built on a Music Man head, dialed in atgain 5.5/10, bass 5, mid 6, treble 6.5, presence 5.5(community-researched baseline). Full breakdown below — then adapt every knob to your exact guitar and amp, ...\\n\\nBarracuda Riff Tone Settings | Heart | TonesMatch (https://tonesmatch.com/tones/barracuda-heart-riff-distorted-10055):\\nApril 20, 2026 -Recreate Heart's Barracuda riff tone with amp settings, pickup choice, and pedal chain — adapted to your specific guitar and amp. Free to browse.\\n\\nlead guitar from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart | built with ToneDB (https://www.tonedb.co/tones/heart/barracuda/lead-guitar-3140):\\nRecreate the iconicleadguitartonefrom \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart. Features: Gibson Les Paul, Marshall JMP. Includes complete signal chain,gearrecommendations, and recreation tips.\\n\\nBarracuda by Heart(Solo · Distorted) — Guitar Tone (https://guitartoneadapt.com/tone/barracuda--heart--solo--distorted--guitar/):\\nHow to dial in theBarracuda(Heart)guitartone: amp settings (gain 6, bass 5, mid 6, treble 7),gearand effects. Adapt it to your exactrigfree.\\n\\nToneMirror - Guitar Tone Matcher for Any Song & Any Rig (https://www.tonemirror.so/):\\nMatch anyguitartoneto thegearyou own. Pick any song and get its exact amp settings, pickup position, tuning, and pedal chain, adapted for theguitaror bassrigyou already play.\\n\\nToneMatcher — Recreate Any Song's Guitar Tone With Your Gear (https://tonematcher.com/):\\nAIguitartonerecipes for thegearyou already own. Search any song and get exact amp and pedal settings to recreate its sound with yourrig.\\n\\nlead guitar from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart | built with ToneDB (https://www.tonedb.co/tones/heart/barracuda/lead-guitar):\\nRecreate the iconic lead guitar tone from \\\"barracuda\\\" by heart. Features:Gibson SG Standard (or Ibanez Destroyer), Marshall JMP 100W Super Lead, A/DA Flanger. Includes complete signal chain, gear recommendations, and recreation tips.\\n\\nHeart - Barracuda amp tone | Fractal Audio Systems Forum (https://forum.fractalaudio.com/threads/heart-barracuda-amp-tone.61916/):\\nDecember 19, 2012 -“I paid $140 for the guitar and $160 for the amp. My entire gear investment was 300 bucks (laughs)! That’s what I went on tour with, that rig and a folding chair for an amp stand.” · Click to expand... ... Search the forum and Axe-Change for Javajunkie's very recent Barracuda flanger settings. He painstakingly recreated that signature ADA flanger tone.\\n\\nHow to Recreate the Heart ‘Barracuda’ Gallop Guitar Tone (https://songsfrommemory.com/tone-recipe-how-to-recreate-the-heart-barracuda-gallop/):\\nMay 2, 2026 -Amp Model:USA Lead Brt (Mesa Mark I).Flanger Block: Use the “A/DA Flanger” type. Set the Manual to 2.0 and Feedback to 85% for that metallic “hollowed out” tone.\"}"
